<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n60486" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κῠβέλη</span></b> , ἡ,
			<u>Cybele</u>, <i><span class="en">
			E.
			<u>Ba.</u>
			79
		</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
			Ar.
			<u>Av.</u>
			877
		</span></i>, etc.:—from <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κύβελον</span></b> , τό, or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κύβελα</span></b> , τά, mountain
		in Phrygia, <i><span class="en">
			D.S.
			3.58
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Str.
			12.5.3
		</span></i>:— hence Adj.
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κῠβεληγενής</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
			St.Byz.
		</span></i>:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κῠβήβη</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
			Hippon.
			120
		</span></i> (dub.), <i><span class="en">
			Hdt.
			5.102
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			<u>Anacreont.</u>
			11.1
		</span></i>; equated with Aphrodite by <i><span class="en">
			Charon
		</span></i> Hist. (<u>FHG</u>iv <i><span class="en">
			p.627
		</span></i>):—fem.Adj.
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κῠβηλίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>, ἡ, <u>Cybelian</u>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κυβηλίδος ὄργανα Ῥείης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nonn.
					<u>D.</u>
					10.387
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				14.214
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hippon.
				121
			</span></i>, prob.in <i><span class="en">
				St.Byz.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κυβέλεια</span>
			:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κῠβεληΐς</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				14.10
			</span></i>, al.</div>
